1
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:04,920
栗宝 又到了玩游戏的时间啦
Okay, Chestnut, it's time to play that game

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:07,100
我们边喝酒边交账单的游戏
where we take shots while we pay our bills

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,360
麦克斯神来之笔的取名为
That Max so cleverly named,

4
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:12,140
"我们边喝酒边交账单的游戏"
"That game where we take shots while we pay our bills."

5
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,940
如果你想姐取个更好的名字
Hey, if you want me to think of a better name,

6
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,660
那我们就该停止在付账单时喝酒
we should probably stop taking shots while we pay our bills.

7
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,080
如果这账单是首次警告信
If this bill says first warning,

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,140
我们就喝一杯 另赏栗宝一根胡萝卜
we take a shot, and Chestnut gets a carrot.

9
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,540
如果是最终警告
If it's a final notice,

10
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,820
就赏栗宝两根胡萝卜 我们喝双份酒
Chestnut gets two carrots, and we take a double shot.

11
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,140
如果是已转交到收债公司
And if it's gone into collections,

12
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,360
我们就"饮弹"自尽 并赏栗宝三根胡萝卜
we shoot ourselves, and Chestnut gets three carrots.

13
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,700
另外 姐想喝的时候就要喝
And also, I'm gonna take shots whenever I want to.

14
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,540
好啦 只剩几张账单
All right, only a couple bills to go

15
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,460
但我们口袋也只剩149块钱
and $149 to pay them.

16
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,460
149是单数 喝
That's an odd number. Shots!

17
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,860
我们的电费是72块
Man, our electric bill is $72.

18
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,500
72是双数 喝
That's an even number. Shots!

19
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,299
接下来 我有煤气[屁]
Next up, I have gas.

20
00:00:54,299 --> 00:00:56,764
多谢你这次事先警告啊
Ah, thanks for the heads-up this time.

21
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:01,800
我们还剩77块 而账单是76.84块
We have $77, and the bill's only $76.84.

22
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:03,340
是数字 喝
Numbers! Shots!

23
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:06,700
这是我们第一次收支打平
This is the first time we've ever broken even.

24
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,720
等等 我们收支平衡时 该干嘛啊
Wait, what do we do when we break even?

25
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:09,400
喝酒吗
Shots?

26
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,400
缴清账单 神清气爽
I'm so proud we paid all our bills

27
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,420
真钱付款 我最骄傲
and with actual American dollars this time.

28
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,660
里面可能有掺杂到点古巴比索
There might've been a couple of pesos in the mix,

29
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:37,160
不然就是那个硬币有只新驴子
that or the nickel has a sweet new donkey.

30
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,320
姑娘们快看 我买了新iPhone
Look, girls, I got the new iPhone,

31
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,700
Siri觉得我超幽默呢
and Siri thinks I'm hilarious.

32
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:47,320
听说那台手机镜头很适合自拍
I hear that phone has a great camera for selfies

33
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:49,220
而你的应该是 矮人自拍
or, in your case, elfies.

34
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,420
麦克斯 笑一个
Smile, Max.

35
00:01:53,090 --> 00:01:57,398
漂亮 微话题"孤独终老"
Nice. #willdiealone.

36
00:01:58,727 --> 00:02:01,149
哇 已经有人点赞了
Oh, already got a like.

37
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:02,980
大家安安
Hey, everybody.

38
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:08,220
大消息宣布
Big news.

39
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:11,000
我终于遇到了我"来自梦里的他"
I finally met the man of my dreams.

40
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:14,540
苏菲 这哪算新闻 咱俩都认识几年了
Sophie, that's not news. You've known me for years.

41
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,980
厄尔 或许在不同地点
Oh, Earl, another place,

42
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,720
不同时间 不同女人
another time, another woman,

43
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,000
不同男人的情况下吧
another man.

44
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:24,160
姑娘们 来清理下我的卡座吧
Hey, girls, you better wipe down my booth.

45
00:02:24,740 --> 00:02:26,940
我男朋友在停他的林肯轿车
My boyfriend's parking his Lincoln outside.

46
00:02:27,180 --> 00:02:29,620
他先放我下车 一方面是绅士
Yeah, he dropped me off first 'cause he's a class act

47
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:32,480
一方面是为了要穿上裤子
and 'cause he had to put his pants back on.

48
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:37,080
你在这儿啊 我的小可爱[花生]
There she is. There's my peanut.

49
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:40,960
你们听到没 他叫我"小可爱"
You hear that? He calls me his peanut.

50
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:43,380
我勒个去
Holy crap,

51
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:45,980
才分别一会 她又更漂亮了
she's looking even prettier than the last time I saw her.

52
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,160
你做了什么
What'd you do,

53
00:02:47,340 --> 00:02:50,020
下车走到餐厅的路上你抹了"美颜霜"吗
get some beauty creams on the way from the car to the diner?

54
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,780
可能是哦
Oh, maybe.

55
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:57,140
苏菲 很高兴看到你爱得爽歪歪的
Sophie, it's nice to see you so giddy about something.

56
00:02:57,340 --> 00:02:58,540
你的样子就跟我
Yeah, you're like me sitting on

57
00:02:58,540 --> 00:03:00,080
坐在洗衣店爆震的机器上时一样爽
that broken washer at the laundromat.

58
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:04,560
我叫尼奇 但我的朋友叫我...
I'm Nicky, but my friends call me

59
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,660
时都是为了借钱
when they need money.

60
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,940
我叫卡洛琳 她叫麦克斯
I'm Caroline. This is Max.

61
00:03:10,140 --> 00:03:11,280
我每次看到你这个年纪的男人
I'm gonna ask you the same question

62
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,820
我都会问同个问题
I ask every guy around your age.

63
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:13,760
你是我亲爹吗
Are you my dad?

64
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,020
能请其中一位美女
Maybe one of you dolls can get me

65
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:18,737
帮忙倒杯水 我好吞下抗胃酸钙片吗
a glass of water to wash down my tums?

66
00:03:18,737 --> 00:03:22,350
他又性感又有胃溃疡
Sexy and he has an ulcer.

67
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,840
行 我顺便去给你们拿菜单跟酒单
Sure, I'll go get you some menus and the wine list.

68
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:26,200
不用太开心
Don't get excited.

69
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:27,280
单子上只有
That's just a list of everything

70
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,000
卡洛琳去年唧歪[酒]过的事情而已
Caroline's whined about in the last year.

71
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:33,300
那位罗伯特·得脑弱是什么来路
What's up with Robert De Zero over there?

72
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:36,900
我以前也有过那样的皮衣
I used to have a leather jacket like that.

73
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:39,860
但我发现 男子汉大丈夫 能露手臂
Then I realized, when you have the right to bear arms,

74
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,240
就必须露之 宝贝
you bare them, baby.

75
00:03:43,592 --> 00:03:45,703
煎蛋 上菜
Omelet. Pick up.

76
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,400
奥列格是在嫉妒吧
I think Oleg just got jealous.

77
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:52,000
奥列格还掉了不少腋毛屑在蛋上
I think Oleg just got underarm dandruff in these eggs.

78
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:53,800
请享用
Enjoy.

79
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:56,820
这是你们的菜单
Here are your menus,

80
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:59,560
菜单上有配图的从1974年开始就没货
and we're out of everything in the pictures since 1974.

81
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:01,900
图上笑着吃松饼的小姑娘
So the little girl smiling eating a waffle,

82
00:04:02,020 --> 00:04:04,380
已经当上奶奶 宾州车站就是她的家
she's a grandma now, and she calls Penn Station home.

83
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,400
美女们拿去 麻烦你们了
Here you go, dolls, for your trouble.

84
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,620
一百块 这就像天上掉钱一样
100 bucks? It's like free money.

85
00:04:12,620 --> 00:04:14,620
如果给他的是干净的杯子
Can you imagine what he would've given us

86
00:04:14,620 --> 00:04:15,640
他会给多少小费啊
if the glasses were clean?

87
00:04:17,140 --> 00:04:19,400
啥事都没做就赚到这么多钱
All this money and I didn't even do anything.

88
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:21,780
我再加撇小胡子就能当卡戴珊了
I'm one mustache away from being a Kardashian.

89
00:04:22,928 --> 00:04:26,040
尼奇是大牌私人庄家
Yeah, Nicky's a big-shot bookie

90
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,720
有一只约克夏
with a yorkie and a membership

91
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,360
还有赛马场的贵宾室会员
to the vip lounge at the race track.

92
00:04:30,420 --> 00:04:32,640
有约克夏还有绿色皮衣
A yorkie and a green leather jacket?

93
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,080
你简直梦幻得不真实
Are you even real?

94
00:04:35,180 --> 00:04:36,740
我超喜欢赛马
I love horse racing.

95
00:04:36,780 --> 00:04:38,460
我以前常去赛马场
I used to go to the track all the time,

96
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,840
不是我显摆 但我有一只纯种马
and not to brag, but I do own a thoroughbred.

97
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,580
她是有一只
Oh, yeah, she does.

98
00:04:42,860 --> 00:04:45,580
我从窗户看过它吃垃圾桶里的东西
I see it eating out of the garbage can from my window.

99
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:48,560
你看 这是栗宝的照片
Here, that's Chestnut.

100
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,160
长得真美
That's a beauty,

101
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,940
但还是没有我身边的小可爱美
but not as much a beauty as my peanut right here.

102
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,720
他刚才把我跟一匹马比了
Oh, he just compared me to a horse,

103
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,300
可姐还是听得心花怒放
But I like it anyway.

104
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:01,640
两位美女何不跟着我们
Why don't you two dolls join us

105
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:03,300
明天下午一起去赛马场的贵宾室
at the track's turf club some afternoon?

106
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:06,271
我们很忙 而且那里很远...
Oh, we're busy, and it's all the way out in--

107
00:05:06,271 --> 00:05:06,920
-你出钱吗 -当然
- Are you paying? - Of course.

108
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,700
那我们一定去
Oh, then we're there.

109
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:10,900
我们何不现在就去
In fact, can we go right now?

110
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,600
是啊 我们俩现在也没事
Yeah, we're not doing anything.

111
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:23,000
麦克斯 你看这马场贵宾俱乐部
Max, look, the turf club.

112
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,380
我们高高在上
Us way up here,

113
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,880
马匹在下面的赛道上
The horses down there on the track

114
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,740
被人强行拉进起跑门栅
being forced into their starting gates.

115
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,500
太让人兴奋了
This is so exciting.

116
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:35,440
小姐 我们才刚到30秒
Girl, we've been here 30 seconds,

117
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,960
你就已经兴奋地吹号[嗑药]了
and you already blew your bugle.

118
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,600
控制一下好吗
Pace yourself.

119
00:05:39,224 --> 00:05:41,040
麦克斯 卡洛琳
Max, Caroline,

120
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:41,960
这边
Over here!

121
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,520
我好久没看苏菲这么开心了
Wow, I haven't seen Sophie this happy

122
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:47,040
上次还是她在我们大楼前
since that girl slipped on the ice

123
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,940
看到有人在冰上滑倒
in front of our building.

124
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,540
那人是我 麦克斯
That girl was me, Max,

125
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:54,080
那次真的伤到我尾椎了
And I really hurt my coccyx.

126
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,640
你有尾椎 这么酷炫啊 改天约一下啊
You have a coccyx? You want to go out sometime?

127
00:05:58,180 --> 00:05:59,180
姑娘们好
Hey, girls.

128
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,860
小可爱 坐过来一点
Come on, peanut. Get a little closer to me.

129
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:03,380
靠近点 再靠近点
Closer. Little closer.

130
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,360
靠近 再靠近一点
Closer. Little closer.

131
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:08,600
姑娘们 我能说啥 离她再近都不够
What can I say, girls? I can't get close enough.

132
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,960
你们听到没 他再近都不够
Do you hear that? He can't get close enough.

133
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:14,640
太感谢你邀请我们来了
Thank you so much for inviting us.

134
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,660
回到赛场的感觉真是太好了
It feels great to be back at the track again.

135
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:18,340
毕竟赛马可以说是
Ah, horse racing is, after all,

136
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,420
王族的运动
the sport of kings.

137
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,540
我对那里的帝王蟹运动比较感兴趣
I'm more interested in the sport Of king crab legs right over there.

138
00:06:23,660 --> 00:06:25,700
所以这里是吃到饱呢
So is this an all-you-can-eat deal here,

139
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:27,100
还是吃到被服务员拉走的那种
or will a waiter come drag me away?

140
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:28,360
爱吃多少吃多少
Knock yourself out.

141
00:06:28,420 --> 00:06:30,800
你这样的姑娘能吃多少呢
How much could a girl like you possibly eat?

142
00:06:31,060 --> 00:06:33,980
你知道眼镜蛇能吞下一整只猪吗
You know how a cobra can swallow an entire pig?

143
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:38,020
她就像那样
It's like that.

144
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,600
卡洛琳 你想要两只还三只
Hey, Caroline, you want two or three?

145
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:43,280
麦克斯说你们是
So Max tells me you met

146
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:45,680
24小时前在24小时健身房碰到的
at 24 Hour Fitness 24 hours ago.

147
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,600
是啊 他在手倒立区发现的我
Yup, he spotted me in a handstand.

148
00:06:51,376 --> 00:06:53,460
尼奇 我该下注哪只
Nicky, who am I gonna bet on?

149
00:06:53,460 --> 00:06:55,700
除了我之外 你喜欢哪个
Who do you like, besides me?

150
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:58,580
苏菲 赌"裙装混乱"这匹马
Sophie, go with Mess In a Dress.

151
00:06:58,660 --> 00:07:00,018
她早晨的冲力很足
She had great morning sprints,

152
00:07:00,018 --> 00:07:01,163
首次戴赛马眼罩[跑较快]
first-time blinkers,

153
00:07:01,420 --> 00:07:02,700
骑师称重低于标准一磅
Jockey weighed in a pound under,

154
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:03,700
在另一赛马大赛中
And at The Preakness,

155
00:07:03,700 --> 00:07:05,740
1.7公里长的比赛 她排第二
She was second in seven furlongs,

156
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:07,280
而这场比赛只有1.2公里长
And this race is only six furlongs.

157
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,520
你说得太长才是真的
Yeah, you're talking for long.

158
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:12,180
我觉得我要赌三号马
Yeah, I think I'm gonna go with number three,

159
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:13,460
"我的汉克叔叔"
My Uncle Hank.

160
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,660
我的汉克叔叔
My uncle Hank?

161
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:15,680
他出狱了吗
He's out of jail?

162
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,600
那我们赶紧吃完就走人吧
Yeah, we should probably eat this and head out.

163
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:21,220
看 那是我选的马
Oh, see, that's my horse.

164
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,500
我的马 "我的汉克叔叔"
My horse, Uncle Hank.

165
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:24,820
看 他刚拉屎了
And look, see? He just pooped.

166
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:26,400
他想装没事逃跑
He's trying to get away from it.

167
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:28,560
这事我懂 我也是这样的
I know about that. That's how I am.

168
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:33,160
好了 得去工作赚钱了
Okay, got to make the donuts, but first,

169
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,560
但老妹 先给哥香一口
give me that kisses, sister.

170
00:07:35,110 --> 00:07:37,460
真浪漫
Aw, so romantic.

171
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,720
麦克斯 或许我们也该加入玩一把
Max, maybe we should get in on the action.

172
00:07:40,620 --> 00:07:41,560
不要 他们太"舌来舌往"了
Nah, that's a lot of tongue for me.

173
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:45,240
我是说下注啦
No, I meant place a bet.

174
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:47,400
麦克斯 我好像被强制加入"三人行"了
And, Max, I think I'm in a three-way.

175
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,600
你加入"三人行"的样子
Well, you look exactly the way I imagined

176
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:53,640
跟我想象中的如出一辙 无聊到读书
you'd look in a three-way--reading.

177
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:57,720
来嘛 我们不是有天上掉下的钱吗
Come on, we have that free money,

178
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,120
而且你明明就爱赌博
and you love to gamble.

179
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:02,440
但我不赌傻逼东西 只赌不戴套之类的事
Yeah, but nothing stupid, just, like, not using a condom.

180
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,520
算了 管它的
Oh, what the hell?

181
00:08:05,156 --> 00:08:07,088
等等 尼奇 给
Wait, wait, Nicky, Nicky, here.

182
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:09,620
这钱给你 "裙装混乱"下注200快
Here's your money. 200 on Mess In a Dress.

183
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:13,080
等等 我觉得我裙中也"混乱"了
Oh, wait, I think I have a mess in my dress.

184
00:08:14,220 --> 00:08:15,220
没问题 美女
You got it, doll,

185
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:18,360
我会叫人再送点特制酥饼过来
and I'm sending over some of those special popovers.

186
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:21,020
苏菲 记得吃一个
Sophie, make sure you get one.

187
00:08:22,180 --> 00:08:23,640
你们听到了没
Oh, do you hear that?

188
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:27,480
其中一个酥饼里面会有戒指
There's gonna be a ring in one of those popovers.

189
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:30,320
我完全没听到这句
I didn't hear any of that.

190
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,660
如果不是为了藏戒指
Well, why else would someone order popovers

191
00:08:32,660 --> 00:08:34,660
谁会没事点酥饼啊
unless they were gonna hide a ring in it?

192
00:08:35,420 --> 00:08:38,060
我刚才把《海底总动员》的全剧组都吃了
I just ate the entire cast of Finding Nemo.

193
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:40,480
我不是吃到恶心
I'm not saying I'm sick.

194
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,300
只是胃里的那条小丑鱼很想逃出来
I'm just saying that clown fish wants out.

195
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:46,420
女士们 下午好 慢慢享用酥饼
Afternoon, ladies. Enjoy the popovers.

196
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:48,920
你吃完了吗
And are you finished with that?

197
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:51,240
应该说它们跟我玩完了
Ah, let's just say it's finished with me.

198
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:52,460
它们出栅了
And they're off.

199
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,680
太刺激了
This is so exciting.

200
00:08:53,820 --> 00:08:55,780
是啊 不知道藏在哪个里
I know. I wonder which one it's in.

201
00:08:56,586 --> 00:08:58,808
好吧 不是这个
Oh. Oh, not that one.

202
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:02,840
好吧 惨了 也不是这个
All right. Whoops, not that one.

203
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:04,660
你看 这是我们的马
Look, look, there's our horse,

204
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,260
"裙装混乱"
Mess in a dress.

205
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:05,980
她领先呢
She's in the lead.

206
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:09,160
不 也不是这个
Oh, no, not that one.

207
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:10,900
好耶 好耶 好耶
Yes, yes, yes.

208
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,500
不要 不要 不要
No, no, no.

209
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:14,860
赢家是"裙装混乱"
And the winner is Mess In a Dress.

210
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,520
我们赢了 赢啦
We won! We won.

211
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,580
我们现在是赢家吗
Are we being winners right now?

212
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:20,980
我都不知道怎么当个赢家
I don't know how to be that.

213
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:22,900
我突然都不知道我的手该放哪了
Suddenly I don't know what to do with my hands.

214
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:24,540
啥都没有
Nothing.

215
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,140
谁会没事点个酥饼
I mean, who in the hell would order popovers

216
00:09:27,140 --> 00:09:29,340
然后里面不藏钻戒啊
and not hide a diamond ring in it?

217
00:09:29,762 --> 00:09:33,616
拿去吧 美女们 六百大洋
Here you go, dolls. 6 big ones.

218
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,240
麦克斯 太棒了
Max, this is incredible.

219
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:39,580
我们本来有两百 现在有六百
We had 200, and now we have 600.

220
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,020
天上掉下来更多的钱
Even more free money.

221
00:09:43,820 --> 00:09:47,220
服务员 给我的小可爱上一份香蕉圣代
And, waiter, bring my peanut one of those banana splits.

222
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,140
你们听到了吗
You hear that?

223
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,280
在香蕉圣代的最下面
There's a diamond ring

224
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:54,280
有一只钻石戒指
in the bottom of the banana split.

225
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,038
利昂 你的辛苦费
And, Leon, for your trouble.

226
00:09:57,038 --> 00:09:57,775
真的吗 一百块
Really? 100?

227
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:01,260
是的 在本宫有钱之前也曾是个女服务员
Yup, I was a waitress before I was rich.

228
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,260
而且在我吃了那鱼之后
And also after that fish,

229
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:05,360
我可能需要你背我去地铁站
I might need you to carry me to the subway.

230
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:21,540
正在摸索我裤子的人啊
Whoever that is going through my pants,

231
00:10:21,540 --> 00:10:22,700
老娘可是有枪的人
you should know I have a gun.

232
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,340
麦克斯 是我 卡洛琳
Max, it's me, Caroline.

233
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,840
所以我才买了把枪啊
Why do you think I bought the gun?

234
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:32,260
麦克斯 你也知道我们就下了一次注
Okay, Max, you know how today we won 600 on our 200

235
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:33,600
就用200块赢了600块吧
after just that one horse race?

236
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:35,540
没错 那是很离奇 但远不如
Yeah, that was weird, but not as weird

237
00:10:35,540 --> 00:10:37,381
我睁开眼看见你站在黑暗中
as waking up to see you standing in the dark

238
00:10:37,381 --> 00:10:39,500
跟我的裤子"上三垒"这么离奇
going to third base with my pants.

239
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:41,900
如果我明天用今天赢来的钱去下注
If I bet our winnings with the three-to-one odds

240
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:42,860
赔率一赔三的马
on this horse tomorrow,

241
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:44,480
你知道我能让咱们赚多少钱吗
Do you know how much I can make us?

242
00:10:45,160 --> 00:10:47,160
我想想 2进位到...滚出去
Let's see. 2, carry the 1--Get out.

243
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:49,420
我这有一份赛马快报
I have the racing form right back here.

244
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:52,020
那玩意碰过你的股沟 别拿上我的床
Don't bring that over here. That's been in your crack.

245
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:53,620
瞧 这里
See? Right here.

246
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:55,420
明天第一场比赛 "喷气飞鲸"
First race tomorrow-- There She Blows.

247
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,320
如果她这么早就起来吹箫[喷气]
If she's blowing that early in the morning,

248
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,300
那这钱也算花得值了
she deserves our money.

249
00:10:59,420 --> 00:11:00,980
我做足了研究
I've done all the research

250
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,060
还跟栗宝确认过了
and checked it with Chestnut.

251
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:04,540
我有十足的把握 就像明天太阳一定会升起
It's a sure thing, like the sun coming up tomorrow

252
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:06,040
或是那个索马里海盗
Or that Somali pirate

253
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,700
很难再有机会接戏一样
never getting another acting job again.

254
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:11,300
你说染赌瘾就染 还光明正大
You go out and get addicted to horse racing

255
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:14,160
而老娘费尽心思 才敢公开我嗑药抽麻
after I worked so hard to put pills and weed on the table?

256
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,100
我才没有染赌瘾
I am not addicted.

257
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:18,920
快说你的钱在哪里
Now, where's your cash?

258
00:11:19,260 --> 00:11:20,420
我知道钱不在小猪扑满里
'cause it wasn't in your piggy bank,

259
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:22,380
因为某个不是我的人 把它打碎了
which someone-- not me--broke.

260
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,600
还觉得自己没染赌瘾吗
You think you don't have a problem?

261
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,880
那好 你可以把钱拿走
Then, fine, you can have the money.

262
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,000
你不会后悔的 钱在哪里
You won't be sorry. Where is it?

263
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,660
在我的咪咪罩里
In my bra.

264
00:11:29,340 --> 00:11:29,900
那你的咪咪罩在哪
Where's your bra?

265
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:30,940
罩在我的咪咪外
On my boobs.

266
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:33,400
你居然穿着咪咪罩睡觉
You sleep in your bra?

267
00:11:33,620 --> 00:11:34,200
没办法
Have to.

268
00:11:34,340 --> 00:11:35,540
上次我晚上把咪咪放出来
Last time I let them out at night,

269
00:11:35,540 --> 00:11:36,840
结果她们到凌晨4点才回来
they didn't come home till 4 A.M.

270
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,100
而且还记不得自己去过哪
and couldn't tell me where they'd been.

271
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:42,020
麦克斯 麻烦把钱拿出来
Max, just take it out of there, please.

272
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,120
不要 我要说出我跟每一个
Nope, I'll tell you what I tell every guy

273
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,920
想伸手进去的男人说过的
who wants to get in there.

274
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:47,320
"成人票12块 敬老票10块半"
It's 12 bucks for adults and 10.50 for seniors.

275
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,400
好吧 我可为了咱俩才这样做
Fine, I'm doing this for both of us.

276
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:55,160
还觉得自己没深陷赌海吗
Still think you don't have a problem?

277
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,420
妈的 在哪儿呢
Geez, where is it?

278
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,220
没有地图或导游吗
Is there a map or a tour guide?

279
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:03,220
就在你的左前方 大概还有20分钟的路程
Coming up on your left. You're about 20 minutes away.

280
00:12:03,620 --> 00:12:05,660
"山峰"比较高 或许你该坐缆车
It's quite a walk. You might want to take the tram.

281
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:08,040
找到了
Got it.

282
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:09,780
自我感觉还良好吗
Feel good about yourself?

283
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:11,340
明天比赛后就会很好了
I will after that race tomorrow.

284
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,860
我保证 不会再有要"伸手"的情况
And I promise I'll never do that again.

285
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:15,600
我汉克叔叔也是这么说的
That's what my Uncle Hank said.

286
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:19,180
我是说绝不会再伸手跟你要钱啦
No, I meant I'll never ask you for money again.

287
00:12:19,220 --> 00:12:20,840
汉克叔叔的老婆也是这么说的
That's what Uncle Hank's wife said.

288
00:12:21,180 --> 00:12:22,220
绝不再赌钱
No more gambling.

289
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:25,160
你是不是看过他的案件资料 每句话都学他
Now I feel like you read the transcript of Uncle Hank's case.

290
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,860
等下 里面还有呢
Oh, wait, you forgot some.

291
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:29,440
逗你玩的 太晚上被人抓挺爽的
Just kidding, it's late, and it felt kind of good.

292
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:38,580
麦克斯 希望卡洛琳能快点来上班
Max, I hope Caroline gets here soon,

293
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:41,380
因为要是她上班迟到了整整四个小时
'cause if that girl walks in one full hour late,

294
00:12:41,380 --> 00:12:43,280
我会忍不住对她跪地膜拜
I'll have to respect the hell out of her.

295
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,860
她还在赛马场
She's still at the track,

296
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:47,960
我超级想知道我们那匹马赢了没有
and I'm dying to know how our horse did.

297
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,040
这种心悬在半空的感觉
So much suspense.

298
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:50,620
让我想在验孕棒上尿尿来应景一下
I feel like I should be peeing on a stick.

299
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:53,620
你们俩还在赌马啊
You girls are still playing the horses.

300
00:12:53,900 --> 00:12:54,860
注意适可而止
Keep that in check.

301
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:56,780
当初我的赌瘾愈演愈烈
My gambling problem got so bad

302
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:59,040
最后都没钱应付我的毒瘾了
I couldn't even afford my drug problem.

303
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,720
你回来啦 情况如何
You're back! So how did we do?

304
00:13:03,900 --> 00:13:04,560
旗开得胜
We did great.

305
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:06,220
我们下注"喷气飞鲸"赢了
We won our bet on There She Blows.

306
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:07,800
太棒了 赢了多少
Yes! How much did we get?

307
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:09,480
有赢到加得起牛油果那么多吗
Are we talking "add avocado" money?

308
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:14,720
一开头旗开得胜 接着不温不火
Well, we did do great, and then we did not great.

309
00:13:15,300 --> 00:13:18,000
然后情况急转直下 之后一落千丈
And then we did bad, and then we did real bad.

310
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:20,140
最后一败涂地
And then we did terrible.

311
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:23,140
长话短说 我的抗胃酸钙片吃完了
Long story short, I'm out of tums,

312
00:13:23,140 --> 00:13:24,560
还有 我们欠尼奇3千块
and we owe Nicky $3,000.

313
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:28,080
是你 你欠尼奇3千块
You--you owe Nicky.

314
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:29,900
当初我沉迷于吃披萨味的品客薯片时
When I got addicted to pizza Pringles,

315
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:31,020
我可没赖你 让你遭罪哦
I didn't make it your problem.

316
00:13:32,820 --> 00:13:35,140
你的口臭让大家都跟着遭罪
Your breath made it all our problems.

317
00:13:36,420 --> 00:13:38,540
麦克斯 尼奇不是什么危险人物吧
Max, Nicky's not, like, dangerous, is he?

318
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,880
应该不是 就算他是
I bet he's not, but even if he is,

319
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:41,320
也不用担心
don't worry.

320
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,800
你可以轻松在林肯车的后备箱里
You can survive in the trunk of Lincoln

321
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:44,100
被关五六天不死 绝对没问题
for five, six days easy.

322
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:47,480
麦克斯 我可以把所有钱都赢回来
Max, I know I can make all of this money back

323
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,900
只要再赢一把就行
if I just win one more race.

324
00:13:48,920 --> 00:13:50,240
只需赌一把有十足把握的
I just need a sure thing.

325
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,840
根本没有什么事能有十足把握
There is no such thing as a sure thing,

326
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:54,940
除了我妈从不来学校接我 这我有十足的把握
except my mother never picking me up from school.

327
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:59,080
明天有两匹马 看起来赢面很大
Look, there are two horses tomorrow that look really good,

328
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:01,740
"削他先生"和"盖里街的小房子"
Buck That and Little House on The Gary.

329
00:14:02,380 --> 00:14:04,900
"盖里街的小房子" 那是我朋友艾迪的马
Little House on The Gary -- that's my friend Eddie's horse.

330
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,080
我们没空陪你玩
We don't have time to pretend

331
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,300
你有一个朋友叫艾迪的游戏
you have a friend named Eddie right now.

332
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:09,900
是真的 艾迪·琼斯
I do. Eddie jones.

333
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,900
他是个有名的骑师 我们在裁缝店认识的
He's a famous jockey. We met at the tailor.

334
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:14,540
我们在裁裤腿的时候聊了起来
We got to talking as we were both having our jeans hemmed.

335
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:16,520
你在哪里买的牛仔裤 杰西潘小尼百货吗
Where'd you buy them, J.C.Puny?

336
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,760
阿憨 拜托 你一定要帮我
Han, please, you have to help me.

337
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,060
去跟你的朋友艾迪聊聊
You have to talk to your friend Eddie

338
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:22,660
帮我搞到明天比赛的消息
and get me the scoop on the race tomorrow.

339
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:24,740
好吧 但有一个条件
Okay, I'll help on one condition:

340
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,560
不许麦克斯再嘲笑我矮
No more short jokes from Max.

341
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:27,600
她可以的
She can do that.

342
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:28,960
你可以的对吧 麦克斯 不要回答
You can do that, right, Max? Don't answer.

343
00:14:29,140 --> 00:14:30,580
所以从现在开始 不许再说嘲笑矮子的...
So no more short jokes starting right--

344
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:31,760
好吧 但首先
Okay, wait, but first,

345
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,200
我是不是在婴儿食品罐上见过你啊
didn't I see you on a baby food jar?

346
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:36,180
老鼠弄了个小小捕鼠器来抓你
A mouse set a trap for you.

347
00:14:36,300 --> 00:14:37,960
你个霍比特人 不是要把魔戒送到魔多吗
And don't you have to bring a ring to Mordor?

348
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:44,120
好了 可以了
Okay, let's do this.

349
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,800
艾迪说让我们来下面找他
Eddie said he'd meet us down here.

350
00:14:49,140 --> 00:14:50,540
阿憨 真是太感谢你了
Han, I really appreciate this.

351
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,400
你真是帮了我一个很大很大的忙
You're doing me such a big, big favor.

352
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,200
我们都很意外 你能做任何跟"大"有关的事
Yeah, and we're surprised you can do anything big.

353
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:55,620
我受够了
Okay, that's it.

354
00:14:56,116 --> 00:14:57,080
阿憨 别走啊
Han, wait.

355
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,160
老子不干了
I don't need it!

356
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:00,480
麦克斯 瞧你做的好事
Max, see what you did?

357
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,140
怎么了 我现在是自动模式
What? I was on autopilot.

358
00:15:02,180 --> 00:15:02,860
我刚说什么了
What did I say?

359
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:07,200
阿憨 麦克斯保证不会再犯了
Han, please, Max won't say anything.

360
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,740
很好 因为我的容忍是有限度的
Good, 'cause I've had it up to here.

361
00:15:08,820 --> 00:15:09,960
个子小所以肚量也小吗
You don't have it up to there.

362
00:15:11,140 --> 00:15:11,900
老子不干了
Don't need it!

363
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:13,660
麦克斯
Max!

364
00:15:13,660 --> 00:15:16,140
求你不要再开这种玩笑了
Please, you have to stop with the short jokes.

365
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,300
这可事关我的人生
This is my life.

366
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:18,520
但吐槽不倦就是我的人生
But that's my life.

367
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:21,780
那你继续 很快我就会被扔进东河底
Keep it up, and I'm gonna be at the bottom of the East River

368
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:23,500
跟你从布鲁克林大桥推下去的
with that hipster artisan cheese truck

369
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:24,860
那辆嬉皮士手工奶酪车双宿双栖
you pushed off the Brooklyn bridge.

370
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,300
你说得对 我不会再开那种玩笑了
You're right. No more short jokes.

371
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:33,400
要不我还是在外面等吧
Maybe I should wait outside.

372
00:15:34,780 --> 00:15:35,780
阿憨 艾迪在哪里
So, Han, where's Eddie?

373
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:37,620
我们得在麦克斯憋昏前
I think we should talk to him as quickly as possible

374
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:38,780
尽快跟他把话说完
before Max passes out.

375
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:42,100
我没看见他 但等的时间应该会很"短"
I don't see him. I'm sure he'll be here shortly.

376
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:44,660
我都憋到内伤了
And I just bit the inside of my mouth.

377
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,800
阿憨
Hey, it's Han!

378
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:48,560
自从上次简"短"的旅程后 就再没见过面了
I haven't seen you since we took our little trip.

379
00:15:49,740 --> 00:15:51,681
哪有 上次我主办的"小"店主垒球赛
No, man, I saw you after my small business

380
00:15:51,681 --> 00:15:53,518
结束后我还见过你
owners softball game.

381
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:56,400
对了 我买了辆新车 "迷你"库柏哦
Hey, I got new car, a Mini Cooper.

382
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,560
这就是地狱 老娘身在地狱
This is hell. I'm in hell.

383
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:00,880
你好 艾迪
Eddie, hi,

384
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:02,840
你能跟我说说今天的比赛吗
is there anything you can tell me about today's race?

385
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,920
有没有稳赢的
Is there a sure thing?

386
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:05,860
你最近赌运不佳吗
Oh, you get yourself a bad bet?

387
00:16:06,380 --> 00:16:07,520
何止不佳 简直糟透了
Bad bet and beyond.

388
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:09,700
跟你说个"小"贴士
Well, let me give you a little tip.

389
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:10,320
我在外面等你
I'll be outside.

390
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:18,180
最后冲刺
And coming down the home stretch,

391
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:19,620
"盖里街的小屋子"暂时领先
Little House on The Gary has the lead.

392
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:21,520
加油 "盖里街的小屋子"
Come on, Little House on The Gary!

393
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:23,800
快跑 就像卡洛琳在日落后
Run! Run like Caroline after sundown

394
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:24,900
经过外国人社区那样狂奔
in an ethnic neighborhood.

395
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:28,800
马儿马儿 快快跑
The hoof, the hoof, the hoof is on fire!

396
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:32,100
要赢了 要赢了
He's winning. He's winning.

397
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,920
要赢了
He's winning!

398
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:35,120
天啊 怎么回事
Oh, no, what's happening?

399
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,420
他落后了
He's falling behind.

400
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:38,560
上帝啊 我最最亲爱的上帝
Oh, lord. Oh, my sweet, sweet lord.

401
00:16:39,260 --> 00:16:41,160
要输了 要输了
He's losing. He's losing.

402
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,240
要输了
He's losing.

403
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,260
阿憨 你怎么解释
Han, what is happening?

404
00:16:44,260 --> 00:16:45,820
或许我该走了
Well, maybe I'll take off.

405
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,520
你朋友说过有十足的把握
Your friend said it was a sure thing.

406
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:50,740
都说不存在什么十足的把握
There is no sure thing

407
00:16:50,740 --> 00:16:52,620
除了泰勒·斯威夫特一定会再写分手歌
except another Taylor Swift breakup song.

408
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:54,740
"盖里街的小屋子"
And Little House on The Gary

409
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:57,380
摔个狗啃泥 而本次冠军正是"狗啃泥"
falls to pieces as Falls to Pieces wins.

410
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:01,800
如果我们的马最后跑完
So what do we win if our horse finishes last

411
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:03,800
还硬着个大鸡鸡闲晃 我们能赢啥
and wanders around the track with a giant erection?

412
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:07,620
费了半天劲 居然输了
All that and we lost?

413
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:09,500
谢谢你的午餐
Thanks for lunch.

414
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:14,020
阿憨 你小到可以把迷你糖果盒当房子
Han, you're so small your house is a Tic Tac box.

415
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:16,920
你小到可以坐进你车的杯架里
You're so small you ride in your car cupholder.

416
00:17:17,020 --> 00:17:18,040
你小到让人怀疑
You're so small your parents

417
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:19,340
你的父母是瓢虫和小炸土豆块
are a ladybug and a tater tot.

418
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:22,280
眉宇之间还真看得出来
I could see that, actually.

419
00:17:23,320 --> 00:17:24,460
老子不干了
I don't need it!

420
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,420
瞧 卡洛琳
You see, Caroline?

421
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:31,560
所以我才退出赌坛
This is why I quit gambling,

422
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:34,240
因为理智和自动扶梯总是会崩溃
This and the escalator was always broken.

423
00:17:35,298 --> 00:17:38,080
好啦 消消气
All right, let's just calm down.

424
00:17:38,080 --> 00:17:40,158
这里是赛马场 不是黑帮电影《好家伙》
This is the turf club, not Goodfellas,

425
00:17:40,158 --> 00:17:41,940
虽然这是根据真人真事改编
Though that was placed on real-life events

426
00:17:41,940 --> 00:17:43,300
而且就发生在离这不远的地方
And took place not that far from here.

427
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:46,360
好吧 或许他不会对我们这么狠
Right, and maybe he won't be so hard on us.

428
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:47,780
尼奇是苏菲的男朋友
Nicky is Sophie's boyfriend.

429
00:17:48,140 --> 00:17:49,820
我刚和尼奇分手了
Well, I just broke up with Nicky.

430
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,120
为什么
Why?

431
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:55,020
我看见他把一个欠他钱的人打个半死
I just saw him beat the crap out of some guy that owed him money.

432
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:59,000
完了 他来了
Oh, no, here he comes.

433
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,720
你们好啊 美女
There you are, dolls.

434
00:18:05,660 --> 00:18:07,160
下一个折断的就是我的狗腿
My leg is next.

435
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,640
真倒霉
Tough break.

436
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:12,240
我得拿上我3千块走人了
I'm gonna take my 3 grand and go.

437
00:18:12,760 --> 00:18:13,640
小可爱跟我分手了
Peanut just broke up with me,

438
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,420
我要回家
so I'm gonna go home

439
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:17,140
跟我的狗和我老婆一起上床休息了
and get in bed with my dog and my wife.

440
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:21,460
我得对你坦白 我们没钱还你
I have to come clean. We don't have your money.

441
00:18:21,520 --> 00:18:22,760
后来我失手了
I got out of control.

442
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:25,640
美女 别紧张 我是个讲理的人
Doll, relax. I'm a reasonable man.

443
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,060
我们可以商量的嘛
We can work out something.

444
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:28,600
那就好
Oh, good.

445
00:18:29,020 --> 00:18:30,080
希望他先开枪打死我
Hope he shoots me first.

446
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:31,640
我宁愿死 也不想听你求他
I'd rather be dead than hear you beg.

447
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,500
你的纯种马还在吗
Still got that thoroughbred?

448
00:18:35,798 --> 00:18:37,804
我明天过来把它带走
I'll come by tomorrow to get it.

449
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:42,040
他不能夺走我的马
He can't take my horse.

450
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,280
我该怎么办
What am I gonna do?

451
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,800
你可以搬去纽约 改名叫麦克斯
You can always move to New York and change your name to Max.

452
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:46,700
等等 我已经这么做了
Wait, I already did that.

453
00:18:47,880 --> 00:18:49,500
我真是脑子被马踢了
What is wrong with me?

454
00:18:49,580 --> 00:18:50,760
我早该明白
I should have known better.

455
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:52,460
我爸就是因为钱进监狱
My father has problems with money.

456
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,420
我肯定有遗传他
It's in my DNA.

457
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,960
现在因为这一次愚蠢的赌马
And now all because of a stupid bet,

458
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,320
我要失去栗宝了
I'm gonna lose Chestnut.

459
00:18:58,020 --> 00:18:59,240
如果能让你感觉好过点
If it makes you feel any better,

460
00:18:59,300 --> 00:19:00,700
我妈有次打赌 还把我输了呢
my mom once lost me in a bet.

461
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:03,840
她居然认为罗伯特·雷德福有演《窈窕淑男》
Still can't believe she thought Robert Redford was in Tootsie.

462
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,557
我们不能失去栗宝
We can't lose Chestnut.

463
00:19:06,557 --> 00:19:09,160
我靠 我靠 都怪你个笨蛋
Damn it, damn it, damn it, people.

464
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,860
害我得再出江湖
Make me come out of retirement

465
00:19:10,860 --> 00:19:12,720
帮你们擦赌输的屁股
just save your gambling asses.

466
00:19:13,020 --> 00:19:15,360
我只需要100块
Now, all I need is 100 bucks.

467
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,080
卡洛琳 你怀孕到生孩子要多久
Hey, Caroline, how fast can you have a baby?

468
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:21,180
你好 利昂
Hey. Hi, Leon.

469
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:23,600
还记得我们吗 给了你100块小费那俩
Remember us, the ones who tipped you 100 bucks?

470
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,000
当然记得 在这里
Oh, of course, it's hard to find

471
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,380
很少有出手这么大方的人
that kind of generosity in this place.

472
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:28,020
顿时让我再次心怀希望
It gives you hope again.

473
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:31,660
不好意思 你得把钱还给我们
Yeah, we're gonna need that back.

474
00:19:32,660 --> 00:19:34,320
老实说 我需要这钱
Well, actually, I need all my money.

475
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,560
我上有高堂啊
I support my mother.

476
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,720
改天再好好孝顺吧
Yeah, maybe not today.

477
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,940
麦克斯 我真不敢相信
Max, I can't believe it.

478
00:19:44,980 --> 00:19:47,260
我不但害了自己 还害了我骑的那匹马
I screwed me and the horse I rode in on.

479
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:49,780
你何不"骑"着它拍部电影 把钱都赚回来
Why don't you film that and get your money back?

480
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:53,340
卡洛琳 瞧
Caroline, look.

481
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:56,240
厄尔 你做到了
Earl, you did it.

482
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:57,660
你救了栗宝
You saved Chestnut.

483
00:19:58,040 --> 00:19:59,380
是啊 我俩都是棕色种马
Yeah, well, we brown studs

484
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,560
当然要互相支持
have to stick together.

485
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,240
这钱我来收
And I'll take that.

486
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:07,520
因为我也不相信我自己
And since I don't trust myself,

487
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:10,700
所以我要把这200块捐给我最爱的慈善机构
I'm donating this 200 to my favorite charity,

488
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:12,280
给
So here.

489
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:16,380
不许再赌了
Now, no more betting,

490
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:19,140
人生中唯一有十足把握的就是人必有一死
'cause the only sure thing in life is death.

491
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:20,640
祝你们愉快
Have a nice day.

492
00:20:29,220 --> 00:20:31,000
一张给你 一张给我
One for you, and one for me.

493
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:33,000
200块 又回到了天刚掉钱那会
200, we're back to our free money,

494
00:20:33,100 --> 00:20:35,480
这一次要立马把钱存起来
And this time, it's going right in the savings account.

495
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,280
那家银行"利息"不"大"
Well, it's not earning much interest in there.

496
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:39,260
存这里
Here.

497
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:42,240
这家银行有两家"大分行"哦
We're keeping this in a bank with two major branches.
